<div class="space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
    <p>By creating a tenant account, you agree to use the A6 Apartments monitoring system according to these terms.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">1. Account.</strong> You must give accurate personal details and keep your login private. You are responsible for activity under your account.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">2. Tenant type.</strong> You may register only as a Regular tenant or a Bills only tenant. Regular tenants may be assigned a room and see full billing. Bills only tenants have access limited to assigned bills and payments.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">3. Billing and payments.</strong> Published bills, remaining balances, and recorded payments shown in the system are the official records used by A6 Apartments staff. Raise any dispute with building management promptly.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">4. Information use.</strong> Information you submit may be used for room assignment, billing, payments, announcements, and related apartment operations.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">5. Acceptable use.</strong> Do not attempt to access another tenant’s account, alter records, or misuse the system.</p>
    <p><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">6. Changes.</strong> A6 Apartments may update these terms as operations change. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms.</p>
</div>
